+    Create a new repository document from a standard template.
+    1. Select document type.
+    2. Determine next available document ID.
+    3. Prompt for document title.
+    4. Select the correct template.
+    5. Generate filename.
+    6. Create the document.
+    7. Populate standard metadata.
+    8. Report success.
+    - Automatic dates
+    - Metadata validation
+    - Repository index updates
+    - Git integration
+    """Main entry point."""
+    print("ADE Document Creator")
+    print("--------------------")
+    VALID_TYPES = ("GOV", "ARC", "ADR", "SPEC", "PUB")
+    document_type = input(
+        f"Document type {VALID_TYPES}: "
+    ).strip().upper()
+    if document_type in VALID_TYPES:
+        break
+    print("Invalid document type.\n")
+    title = input("Document title: ")
+    print()
+    print("Summary")
+    print(f"Type : {document_type}")
+    print(f"Title: {title}")
